---
import FigureShell from '../FigureShell.astro'
const stages = [
  ['输入 x', '保留残差 x'],
  ['RMSNorm → 自注意力', 'Q/K Norm · RoPE · KV'],
  ['h = x + Attention(Norm(x))', '第一条残差'],
  ['RMSNorm → Gated MLP', 'SiLU(gate) × up → down'],
  ['y = h + MLP(Norm(h))', '第二条残差'],
]
---
<FigureShell label="固定快照 Qwen3 层：两条残差">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 280 390" role="img" aria-label="输入 x 经归一化和自注意力后加回 x；再归一化并经门控 MLP 后加回 h" class="mx-auto block h-auto w-full max-w-88 font-sans text-[12px] [&_text]:fill-ink">
    {stages.map(([title, detail], i) => <g>
      <rect x="8" y={8 + i * 77} width="264" height="57" rx="4" class={i === 2 || i === 4 ? 'fill-accent-soft stroke-accent' : 'fill-sunken stroke-rule-strong'} />
      <text x="140" y={32 + i * 77} text-anchor="middle">{title}</text>
      <text x="140" y={52 + i * 77} text-anchor="middle" class="fill-muted!">{detail}</text>
      {i < 4 && <path d={`M140 ${67 + i * 77}v14m-4-4 4 4 4-4`} class="fill-none stroke-muted" />}
    </g>)}
  </svg>
  <Fragment slot="caption">两条残差分别加回 x 与 h。固定实现允许 add 与下一次 RMSNorm 融合执行；融合改变调用边界，模型里的两次相加仍然存在。图不按运行耗时比例绘制。</Fragment>
</FigureShell>
